<h3><u>Kullo yaumin ashura</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Kullo yaumin ashura<br />
Yaa hussain<br />
Ya hussain, ya hussain<br />
(Kullo yaumin ashura, kullo arzin karbala) x2<br />
(Yaa abal abrar) x2 Yaa hussain</p>

<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. Kabhi nabi ke kalmago the kabhi namazen parte the Karbobala me sibte nabi ke khoon ke lekin pyase the<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Hifz kiya quraan magar ye qaule nabi naa yaad raha) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Har kuleman haramahum wa silmun liman saal mahum) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Inse rifaqat mujhse rifaqat inka adu dushman hai mera<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Yaa abal abrar) x2 Yaa husain<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Yaa husain, yaa husain.<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Kullo yaumin aashura Kullo arzin karbala) x2 (Yaa abal abrar) x2 Yaa husain</p>

<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. Sab ko khabar hai sabko pata hai khuld bari ke malik hai<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Saaqi-e-qausar kasime jannat arsho zami(n) ke malik hai<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Shimre sitamgar such zara to kaat raha hai kiska gala) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Ad gule man ada hum va mohibbun leman ahbahum) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Inka adu hai mera dushman, dost hai inka dost mera<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Yaa abal abrar) x2 Yaa husain<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Yaa husain, yaa husain. (Kullo yaumin aashura Kullo arzin karbala) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Yaa abal abrar) x2 Yaa husain<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. Laymo ka laymi damo ka dami nafso ka nafsi jin ko kaha<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pyar na bas hasnayno zahera maula ali thi zere kissa<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Sad afsos bhulaya tumne kaule rasule akram ka) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ruhe payambar ruhe zahera keyu na kare phir vavayla<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Yaa husain, yaa husain. (Kullo yaumin aashura Kullo arzin karbala) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Yaa abal abrar) x2 Yaa husain<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; 4.Jiske liye tathir ki chadar aayat ban kar aayi thi<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Dasht-e-bala me nange sar wo zaynab, zahera jayi thi<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Balo se parda karti thi karti thi ye aaho buka) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Qatl kiya mere bhai ko chhinli mere sarse rida<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Yaa husain, yaa husain. (Kullo yaumin aashura Kullo arzin karbala) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Yaa abal abrar) x2 Yaa husain</p>

<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5.Bade nabi ke zulm uthhaye ahele sitam ne zahera par<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Qati kiya jalti reti par binte nabi kaa lakhte jigar<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Ik taraf tha pyas kaa chehra ek taraf behta dariya) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; laasha-e-sarvar ahle jafaa ne ghoro(n) se pamal kiya<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Yaa husain, yaa husain. (Kullo yaumin aashura Kullo arzin karbala) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Yaa abal abrar) x2 Yaa husain<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; 6.Subhe dahem shabbir ne jab akber se kaha azan kaho<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; Wale shahadat aa pahucha hai shukre khuda har aan karo<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; (Ham nati ke quraan hain beta quraan suno quraan paro) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; Teri aza aagaz hai beta our anjam sajda mera<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; Yaa husain, yaa husain. (Kullo yaumin aashura Kullo arzin karbala) x2<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp; (Yaa abal abrar) x2 Yaa husain</p>
</p>